Subject: AW: [unmarked] How are fitted values calculated from a colext fit?
Message-ID: <LvLJj2xoe1s.a04oYHUUaJAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <LvLJj2xoe1s.MXFzKr6TKeQJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
References: <LvLJj2xoe1s.QnZVfjT9QtEJ@unmarked.groups.google.com> <LvLJj2xoe1s.MXFzKr6TKeQJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
